{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-225":{"renderings":[{"id":"37d8134272962433","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Expresses 'not difficult to ~' in a formal/literary sense; e.g., 'not hard to imagine/understand'."},{"id":"31753f5ef39976ef","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～に難くない (～にかたくない) grammar is typically used in formal or literary contexts to indicate that something is not difficult. Common expressions include 想像に難くない ('not hard to imagine'), 理解に難くない ('not difficult to understand'), 察するに難くない, and so on."},{"id":"2e80712759fb847a","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-dictionary form + に難くない (commonly with 想像する, 理解する, 察する, etc.)"},{"id":"fd3f9551c95c0c85","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"に難くない: not hard to (想像に難くない)."},{"id":"6b1e4cc3700c0626","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"ease"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Ease (Easy To / Hard To)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"ease"}}]},"n1-225#c7bad2dd3efe":{"renderings":[{"id":"7571d90f6fe24209","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"It's not hard to imagine his delight."}]},"n1-225#46db7a8c0e90":{"renderings":[{"id":"49604fb55e3f437c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"It's not difficult to understand that this outcome disappointed her."}]},"n1-225#6db15b873f0d":{"renderings":[{"id":"d03a3ef680430354","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"It's not hard to guess why he is angry."}]},"n1-225#90e111f60436":{"renderings":[{"id":"76c0082487258b2d","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-225"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"It's not hard to imagine why this situation occurred."}]}}}